window.products.push({"id":1186054,"name":"Foto&Tech 28-Slot High Capacity SD Memory Card Case, Shockproof SD CF SDHC SDXC Micro SD Storage Box for 8 SD 4 CF 9 TF, Waterproof Card Holder Micro ","category":"electronics","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ZG9B+RfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: Made of ABS plastic and thermoplastic rubber – durable, can handle abrasion but comfortable to touch. Thick and solid, it can withstand getting dropped, water, and sand.  Allows you store 8 SD cards, 4 CF cards, 9 TF/Micro SD cards, 2 pin key/card pin, 1 Standard SIM, 2 Micro-SIM, and 2 Nano-SIM cards. With precision slots, it fits your various memory cards. Keeps your cards organized and clean before handing out. Convex design on the case makes card case more ergonomic and more comfortable. Compact and lightweight design, convenient to carry. Specifications: Material: ABS (Acrylonitrile-Butadiene-Styrene), PC (Polycarbonate), TPV (Thermoplastic vulcanizates) Size: 4.5 x 2.7 x 0.8 inches weight : 4oz / 115g, great for travel Color: Black + Blue Package contents:  Water-Resistant Memory Card Storage Case x1 Pin key x1 The waterproof rubber seal keeps unwanted debris and water from entering the case. Note:  1. Memory Card Case Only, Compact Flash card, Micro SD card and SD card are NOT included 2. Do not carry the case with you on a dive or swim for a long time.It can shield your memory cards when some water sprayed on it, like rain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ZG9B+RfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foto&Tech","source_asin":"B077HG3Q5M","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1186054","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077HG3Q5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B077HG3Q5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1186055,"name":"SUUNTO Altimax Altimeter Barometer Watch","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UolooVNRL._AC_UL1200_.jpg","description":"With an easy to read display, the Suunto Vector wristop computer allows you to time your ascent, figure the altitude, find your bearings, and check the weather. A barometric pressure chart in the top left corner can also alert you when a storm may be moving in so you can be prepared for anything than may head your way. All the data you need in the outdoors is just a glance away with the Suunto Vector Wristop Computer. Get all the functionality of an altimeter, barometer, and compass in a stylish design that won the European Outdoor Award Product of the Year for 1999/2000. The Vector looks like a high-end wristwatch, with an ABS plastic body and elastic wristband. The body is black, with a ring of yellow around the dial and an oversized backlit LCD screen. The Vector is made tough, built to be waterproof even submerged up to 100 feet. The watch displays day, time, and date with three programmable alarms plus a stopwatch and countdown timer. But the Vector really stands out in its combination of altimeter, barometer, and compass functions. The altimeter allows you to view the current altitude with a range up to 29,500 feet and a resolution of 10 feet. Also view your ascent/descent rate in feet per minute. (All measurements are also available in metric units.) The barometer allows you to measure the temperature in Celsius or Fahrenheit, absolute pressure, and a difference measurement to follow changes in barometric pressure and temperature. The automatic four-day memory keeps track of atmospheric pressure information. Another feature is the adjustable sea-level pressure function. The Vector's compass shows directional bearing in degrees and cardinal or half-cardinal point. There is a north-south arrow and a bearing tracking function that displays locked bearing, actual bearing, and the difference between these declination adjustments. The compass's bubble level indicates a level position to ensure a reading accuracy to within 2 to 3 degrees. The Vector comes with a user-replaceable battery, which lasts up to 18 months, and a low-battery indicator. The Vector is covered by a one-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UolooVNRL._AC_UL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUUNTO","source_asin":"B000051SEN","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1186055","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000051SEN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000051SEN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
