window.products.push({"id":1186123,"name":"Corsair Accelerator Series 30 GB SSD Cache Drive CSSD-C30GB","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MBNayk1RL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Boost hard drive read/write performance as much as 5x with an Accelerator Series SSD cache drive. The simple installation and intelligent caching let you experience faster boot up and application load times immediately. From the Manufacturer An Accelerator Series SSD cache drive doesn't replace your hard drive — it just makes it faster. An easy and affordable way to boost system performance up to 5x Using an Accelerator Series™ solid-state cache drive can boost your system's read and write performance up to 5x compared to using a hard drive alone. Just add the cache drive to your system, download and install the intelligent caching software, and start enjoying faster boot times and quicker file access. Automatic performance. There are no new drive letters to manage, no need to manually move your programs or data, and no reinstalling of Microsoft® Windows® or your applications. Just connect the hardware, download and install the software, and restart your system. The intelligent caching software, developed for Corsair by NVELO, automatically learns which files and programs you access the most and optimizes system performance by caching these to the Accelerator SSD. And because it learns as it goes, the caching gets more efficient the more consistently you use your PC. Upgrade your upgrade experience. You don't need to uninstall, reinstall, or move your existing hard drive. Just mount the Accelerator Series cache drive in an unused drive bay and attach a SATA cable and an internal power cable. Download and install the caching software, and you're ready to go. Break the bottleneck without breaking the bank. An Accelerator Series SSD is a great choice if you want to significantly boost your system's speed but you don't want to invest the time or cost of a complete system overhaul. Your PC will work just as it always has... just a lot more quickly. 30GB, 45GB, or 60GB -- how much do you need? Adding an Accelerator Series SSD cache drive won’t increase your disk storage capacity as reported by Windows. Instead, it works invisibly behind the scenes to cache your hard drive’s data. Your hard drive’s size as reported by Windows will stay the same. To choose the capacity that works best, add up the sizes of the applications and files that you use regularly. If you’re not sure, here’s a rule of thumb: if you’re using basic office applications, the 30GB model will do fine. If you play a lot of games or work with video and graphics files, consider the 45GB or 60GB model. And if you use your PC for professional graphics design or video production, you’ll definitely want the 60GB model. Accelerator Series Specifications Accelerator Series SSD cache drives use a standard 2.5\" housing and are backed by a three-year warranty. Capacity 30GB 45GB 60GB Max Sequential Read Speed 270 MB/s 280 MB/s 280 MB/s Max Sequential Write Speed 240 MB/s 270 MB/s 270 MB/s Interface SATA II (3 Gb/s) SATA II (3 Gb/s) SATA II (3 Gb/s) Contents and Specifications Package contents Accelerator Series solid-state cache drive Accelerator Series solid-state cache drive Technical Specifications Interface: SATA II 3.0 Gb/s Interface: SATA II 3.0 Gb/s Operating Temperature: 0°C to +70°C Operating Temperature: 0°C to +70°C Storage Temperature: -20°C to +85°C Storage Temperature: -20°C to +85°C Operating Humidity: 10% to 90% RH (0° to +40° C) Operating Humidity: 10% to 90% RH (0° to +40° C) Storage Humidity: 5% to 90% RH (-10° to +60° C) Storage Humidity: 5% to 90% RH (-10° to +60° C) Maximum Operating Altitude: 3,048 m (up to 10,000 ft.) Maximum Operating Altitude: 3,048 m (up to 10,000 ft.) Maximum Non-Operative Altitude: 12,192 m (up to 40,000 ft.) Maximum Non-Operative Altitude: 12,192 m (up to 40,000 ft.) MTBF: 2,000,000 hours MTBF: 2,000,000 hours Three-year warranty Three-year warranty Compatibility SATA 2 or higher SATA 2 or higher Microsoft® Windows® 7 Microsoft® Windows® 7 2.5\" or 3.5\" hard drive bay 2.5\" or 3.5\" hard drive bay","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MBNayk1RL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Corsair","source_asin":"B007MD2F92","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1186123","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007MD2F92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B007MD2F92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
