window.products.push({"id":1186287,"name":"SanDisk Cruzer Orbit 8GB USB 2.0 Flash Drive- SDCZ58-008G-B35","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6137WCtZWCL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Product Description Combining a 360-degree swivel design with pocket-sized portability, the Cruzer Orbit USB flash drive offers an easy and convenient way to store, transfer, and share your data. This flash drive features a protective cover that rotates to shield the USB connector from damage when it's not in use. With its compact form factor, the flash drive is ideal for data users who need easy, portable access to their most important files. With a design that is both fun and practical, the Cruzer Orbit USB flash drive is built to revolve around your life on the go. Compact Swivel Design Offers Portability and Protection The Cruzer Orbit USB Flash Drive is less than 1.5 inches long and just over a quarter-inch thick, so it's easy to slip in a pocket, backpack, or purse. The flash drive's 360-degree, rotating cover shields the USB connector when it's not in use. Easily attach it to a key ring, three-ring binder, or lanyard for easy portability. SanDisk SecureAccess Software Keeps Files Private The Cruzer Orbit USB Flash Drive comes with SanDisk SecureAccess software, which creates a password-protected folder for your sensitive files. The application uses 128-bit AES encryption, so you'll be able to share your favorite media and USB flash drive while protecting your private documents from unwanted access. From the Manufacturer The Cruzer Orbit USB Flash Drive has a distinctive 360-degree swiveling design for protecting the drive's connector when not in use. This circular-shaped drive also features a convenient place to attach a binder ring or a lanyard. It offers a storage capacity of 8 GB 1 , giving you the space you need to store video, photos, music, and other bulky files. And those files will be safe, thanks to SanDisk SecureAccess software 2 , which provides encrypted password protection for your data. Easily attaches to a binder ring, backpack loop, or lanyard. View larger. Offers 360-degreerevolving protection. View larger. Distinctive Swiveling Design The Cruzer Orbit USB Flash Drive's circular design features a protective cover that rotates 360 degrees to shield or expose the drive's connector. At less than 1-1/2 inches long and 1/4 inch thick, this drive is easy to slip into a pocket or a bag, so your favorite files will be nearby whenever you need them. Easily Attaches to Binder or Lanyard Thanks to a design that revolves around your lifestyle, the Cruzer Orbit USB Flash Drive is easy to bring wherever you go. It's simple to attach the drive to a lanyard, key ring, or binder ring. 8 GB 1 Capacity for HD Video, Photos, Music, and More With a capacity of 8 GB, the Cruzer Orbit USB Flash Drive can store a variety of large files, including high-resolution pictures and HD video. Password Protect Your Private Files 2 With SanDisk SecureAccess software, you can secure your private files in a password-protected folder while keeping your other files available to share. With 128-bit AES encryption, the drive keeps your sensitive files private, even when you share it with friends. What's in the Box Cruzer Orbit USB Flash Drive (8 GB). Cruzer Orbit USB Flash Drive (8 GB) At a Glance: Rotates 360 degrees to protect connector Rotates 360 degrees to protect connector Less than 1-1/2 inches long and 1/4 inch thick Less than 1-1/2 inches long and 1/4 inch thick Easily connects to binder ring or lanyard Easily connects to binder ring or lanyard Password-protection software included2 Password-protection software included 2 STORE YOUR FILES ON A USB FLASH DRIVE and bring your digital life with you wherever you go† CAPACITY PHOTOS (10 MEGAPIXEL) VIDEO (1080 VIDEO AVCHD) MUSIC (MP3 SONGS) OFFICE FILES (GB) 8 GB* 450 photos + 20 minutes + 500 songs + 2 GB 16 GB 900 photos + 40 minutes + 1,000 songs + 4 GB 32 GB 1,800 photos + 80 minutes + 2,000 songs + 8 GB 1 1 gigabyte (GB) = 1 billion bytes. Some capacity not available for data storage. 2 Password protection uses 128-bit AES encryption and is supported by Windows XP, Windows Vista, Windows 7, Windows 8 and Mac OS X v10.5+ (Software download required for Mac, see www.SanDisk.com/SecureAccess).† Approximations: results will vary based on file size, resolution, compression, bit rate, content, host device, pre-loaded files and other factors. See www.sandisk.com.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6137WCtZWCL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SanDisk","source_asin":"B00BPHH8MA","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1186287","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BPHH8MA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BPHH8MA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
