window.products.push({"id":1186305,"name":"Revesun 1x2 HDMI Splitter 1 in 2 out 1080p HDCP 2.2 4k2k Ultra High Definition Splitter HDMI Box DVI 1.0 3D","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51afAh0jktL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introduction This 1 by 2 HDMI UHD Splitter with HDCP 2.2 is an advanced solution for splitting a single HDMI input to two HDMI outputs. It provides high performance audio and video output through HDMI cables up to 4K2K@60Hz (YUV420) resolution and is capable of receiving and transmitting up to 9Gbps of bandwidth with no data loss. Supporting the latest features you can be assured of reliable and high quality HDMI distribution. Package UHD 1x2 HDMI Splitter--1Pcs 5V/1A DC power adaptor----1Pcs User manual--1pcs| Specification; Video Bandwidth ----300MHz/10.2 Gbps Input Ports----1 x HDMI (Female type) Output Ports---- 2 x HDMI (Female type) Output Resolution: 480i ~1080p50/60, 4Kx2K@24/30, 4k2k@60Hz with 12bit YCBCR 4:2:0, VGA~UXGA ESD Protection: Human Body model: ±8 kV (air-gap discharge) ±4 kV (contact discharge) Power Supply:5 V/1A DC Dimensions : 56 mm (W) × 96 mm (D) × 17 mm (H) Weight:100 g Chassis Material:Metal Silkscreen Color:Black Operating Temperature: 0 °C~40 °C/ 32 °F~104 °F Storage Temperature:−20 °C ~ 60 °C/−4 °F ~140 °F Relative Humidity:20~90 % RH (non-condensing) Power Consumption : 1.5W Connect and Operate Connect the signal sources such as Blu-Ray Player, Play Station 3, satellite receivers and computers equipped with HDMI output interfaces with a short high-speed HDMI cable to the HDMI Splitter input. Connect the HDMI outputs from the HDMI Splitter to high-definition display devices such as HD-LCD, HD-DLP and HD projectors with HDMI input interfaces. Use high-speed HDMI cables that are recommended for the distances that are required for each connection. The Splitter is powered by an external power supply which is included. Connect power first to the source, then to the Splitter and then to each HD TV or projector.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51afAh0jktL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Revesun","source_asin":"B014EZ7266","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1186305","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014EZ7266","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B014EZ7266","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
