window.products.push({"id":1186314,"name":"Mount-It! Triple Monitor Stand with Freestanding Base | Computer Screen Desk Mount Fits Up to 27 Inch Monitors, VESA 75, 100 Compatible, Black","category":"electronics","retail price":62.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b0rly1v-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TRIPLE MONITOR DESK STAND: Fits three monitors with screen size between 21 and 27 inches, with a maximum support weight of 22 pounds each, using the 75x75mm or 100x100mm VESA pattern found on the back of the monitors. Measure, in millimeters, the distance between the bolt holes in the pattern on the back of your monitor if unsure of size. FEATURES: Free standing triple monitor desk stand has full motion arms and is made of heavy duty steel and have integrated cable management on each arm to keep your cables out of sight. VESA plates are removable, which makes for easier mounting. Comes with stable free standing base for desktops. EASY INSTALLATION: Triple monitor mount comes with all mounting hardware, tools, and instructions necessary for assembly. Detachable VESA plate heads are mounted to the back of the monitors, and re-attached with a single bolt. Non-skid free stand sits atop any desktop. See instructional video for additional tips on functionality and assembly. TO AVOID TIPPING THE STAND AND MONITORS NEED TO BE BALANCED OVER THE BASE. FULLY ADJUSTABLE: Monitor stand outer arms can tilt 90 degrees up and down, swivel left and right 180 degrees, and raise and lower on the middle pole. Middle screen can be height adjusted, tilted, and swiveled as well. All 3 screens can be placed and held in portrait or landscape orientation independent of one another. TO ALIGN THE HEIGHT OF THE MONITORS, ROTATE THE HEIGHT ADJUSTMENT SCREW BEHIND EACH MONITOR VESA HEAD TO RAISE AND LOWER EACH MONITOR. CENTER MONITOR CAN BE ADJUSTED UP TO 1 INCH. 5-YEAR WARRANTY: 3 monitor mount comes with a 5-year warranty and our friendly and responsive US-based customer support team is available to answer any questions you may have during normal business hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b0rly1v-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mount-It!","source_asin":"B08P2Y49VG","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1186314","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P2Y49VG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P2Y49VG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
