window.products.push({"id":1186322,"name":"H-Squared TVTray Mount for Apple TV 2G-TVTRAY-X","category":"electronics","retail price":50.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616Px3BI8EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The tvTray is both a horizontal and vertical mount for the 2nd generation Apple TV. Perfect for mounting behind flat panel displays, in entertainment centers, or in locations and applications where the Apple TV needs to be located somewhere other than a tabletop. The black cast-acrylic is laser-cut and then hand-crafted to the exact dimenions of the new Apple TV. Ports and the IR receiver on the Apple TV are fully accessible, yet the mount can be used in virtually any orientation. Also includes a channel behind the mount for routing cabling.H-Squared began in 2005 as a small consulting firm for home automation customers. We quickly grew into a manufacturing and fabrication company designing both commercial and custom products for customers all over the world.We now have an immensely popular line of mount products for the Apple AirPort Extreme, Time Capsule, Apple TV, and Mac mini that are sold from our web store and through our network of worldwide distributors. In addition, we're continuously designing and manufacturing custom products for both small and large customers alike. Vertical and horizontal mount for 2nd generation Apple TV.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616Px3BI8EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H-Squared","source_asin":"B004LWO3Y2","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1186322","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004LWO3Y2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B004LWO3Y2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
