window.products.push({"id":1186676,"name":"Orion Star Shoot G4 Color Deep Space Imaging Camera, Black (53088)","category":"electronics","retail price":449.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GYYTO+AAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our fourth generation Star Shoot Imaging Camera features an impressive CCD chip sensor and highly efficient cooling systems to help you capture amazing astrophotos. Star Shoot G4 cameras are some of the \"coolest\" 16 bit imaging devices available at this price range - literally! Regulated thermoelectric cooling (TEC) keeps each camera at least 20-degrees below ambient temperature to eliminate noise for accurate dark frame acquisition and efficient image capture. Thanks to regulated TEC, Star Shoot G4 cameras make it easy to match dark frames night to night, and even hour to hour for impeccable results. Each G4 camera is equipped with a vibration-free fan to further optimize cooling performance. The Star Shoot G4 Color is built around the 1/2\" format Sony ICX829AKL color CCD sensor, which boasts a 752 x 582 pixel array with sensitive, 8.6 micron by 8.3 micron pixels to detect and capture detailed features of deep space objects. Highly efficient Star Shoot G4 cameras can download a full-frame image in just 1.5 seconds, and sub frame capability provides even speedier downloads. With its exposure range of 0.01 seconds to 60 minutes, the Star Shoot G4 is capable of capturing lengthy exposures of faint deep space objects as well as swift snapshots of the Moon and planets. Complete Orion Camera Studio astrophotography imaging software is included with each Star Shoot G4. Orion Camera Studio makes it easy to control image capture, save, process, and share images. ASCOM drivers are included. Versatile Star Shoot G4 cameras can also be used for auto guiding. The compact Star Shoot G4 camera body measures just 2.68\" x 2.75\" x 3.63\" and features a built-in 2\" nosepiece and T-threads as well as a 1.25\" adapter. Includes a 10' USB cable and a 10' 12V auto-lighter socket power cable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GYYTO+AAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orion","source_asin":"B077GPNWHY","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1186676","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077GPNWHY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B077GPNWHY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
