window.products.push({"id":1186752,"name":"Personalized iPad Case for Apple iPad 10.2 inch (2019) (7th Gen), Ipad 7, 360 Swivel Leather Side Flip Cover, Personalize with Image, Customise Photo ","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812IXb6pu7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How To Personalize Your Case? Option 1 - ‘Customize Now’You can now customize your own case through Amazon before checkout when you select ‘Customize Now’ (from the color list). Upload your chosen photo and add text by following the online instructions before checkout. Once you have completed your order we will receive your artwork and your case will be sent straight to production for you. Option 2 - ’Design It For Me’With this option one of our team will design your case for you with your chosen photos (max of 6) and send you a preview for your confirmation. After you have purchased your case:  1. Go to Amazon’s desktop site and login and find your recent orders.  2. Find your product and click 'Contact Seller'.  3. Select 'Product Customisation' from the drop down box.  4. Write any info/requests and attach your images by clicking 'add attachment' (if you are having difficulty attaching your images please try the desktop site or please contact us for help).  5. Click Send E-mail / Send Message.  We will send you back a preview for your confirmation. We will send your order to production after you have confirmed your proof. If we don’t hear from you within two working days we will send your order to production (providing we have received the images for your case). * Please note you will receive message responses through your email address account that is used for your Amazon account, please also check your spam inbox for messages. *Due to the personalised nature of this product it is Non-Refundable and Non-Exchangeable; please check the correct case model is purchased. Features:Button Access Points & Camera Cut-outsHQ ImageNo Signal LossPU LeatherFaux Suede InteriorPrecision Fit To Your Device360 degree swivel functionStanding pointsCard SlotsEnclosed Money/Paper SlotMagnetic Metal Clasp","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812IXb6pu7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hairyworm","source_asin":"B081VPY7LM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1186752","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081VPY7LM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B081VPY7LM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
