window.products.push({"id":1186835,"name":"Headphone Adapter for iPhone,[Apple MFi Certified] 2 Pack 2 in 1 Lightning to 3.5mm Aux Audio and Charge Jack Adapter Splitter Dongle for iPhone 14/13","category":"electronics","retail price":9.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lroLri1cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose iPhone Headphone Adapter? The iPhone Headphone Adapter is a small accessory that allows users to connect their 3.5mm headphones or earphones to iPhones that don't have a built-in headphone jack. Apple removed the headphone jack starting with the iPhone 7, so this adapter has become essential for those who want to use wired headphones with their iPhone. Here are the basics of an iPhone headphone adapter: ❤Efficient Transmission:The lightning to 3.5 mm headphone adapter is built with upgraded Apple MFi Certified DAC Chip to read data fast and ensure the stability and fidelity of sound transmission, which is the first choice for music lovers. This iPhone lightning to 3.5 mm headphone jack adapter perfectly match all 3.5mm earphone/headphone.❤Small and portable:iPhone headphone adapters are usually small and light, making them easy to carry wherever you go. This way you can always connect the headphones to your iPhone.❤Multi Function:iPhone headphone adapter has an extra charging port, allowing you to listen to music while charging your iPhone.There's no need for any additional setup or configuration,making it a convenient solution for those who want to use their headphones with their iPhone.❤Audio Quality: The adapter is designed to maintain the original audio quality of the connected headphones, ensuring users can enjoy high-quality sound without loss of audio fidelity. Extensive Compatibility: iPhone 14/14 Plus/14 Pro/14 Pro MaxiPhone 13/13 Pro/13 Mini/13 Pro MaxiPhone 12/12 Pro/12 Mini/12 Pro MaxiPhone 11/11 Pro/11 Pro MaxiPhone X/XR/XS/XS MaxiPhone 8/8 Plus/7/7 PlusiPhone 6s/6s Plus/6/6 PlusiPhone 5c/SE 2020iPad/iPodWhat You Get:2 Pack iPhone 2 in 1 Lightning to 3.5mm Headphone Audio & Charger Splitter Adapter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lroLri1cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GeydrQ","source_asin":"B0C4LVDDY5","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1186835","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4LVDDY5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4LVDDY5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
