window.products.push({"id":1186980,"name":"Virego F150 Tailgate Handle Camera Compatible with Ford F150 (2005-2014), F250/F350/F450/F550 (2008-2014), Ford Tailgate Handle with Camera, Upgraded ","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816xNPrOHkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DUAL CONTROL FUNCTION UPGRADE: Added ruler switching function and mirror image switching function. The upgraded ford tailgate handle reversing camera adopts 1280(H)x960(V) ultra-high-definition starlight night vision camera. IP68 waterproof, 170° wide viewing angle camera, better night vision performance at night, parking line with \"ON/OFF\" switch. STURDY AND DURABLE TAILGATE HANDLE: Rear view backup camera tailgate handle is made of sturdy ABS plastic for durability. The 26ft video extension cable comes with a tube sleeve and copper core wire for easy connection from the rear tailgate to the front display. It has stable transmission, high temperature resistance and high flame retardancy. EASY TO INSTALL: Our rear view backup camera interface has been upgraded to add knob fixing to prevent the interface from falling off and being waterproof. Universal RCA connector to connect with your aftermarket mirror/video monitor receiver. Before purchasing please check the back of your Monitor/Screen that have a Yellow RCA input for easy installation. PERFRCT FIT: Replace original tailgate handle for Ford F150 (2005-2014), F250/F350/F450/F550/F650/F750 (2008-2014), Mark LT(2006-2014), Super Duty(2008-2015) trucks and fits like OEM. You can also measure the tailgate handle to get a more accurate purchase. AFTER-SALES GUARANTEE: 100% money back guarantee - For whatever reason, you are not satisfied, you can request a replacement or a full refund. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. If you are dissatisfied with the product, contact us! We will show you a sincere attitude and satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816xNPrOHkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Virego","source_asin":"B09NPSMK8N","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1186980","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NPSMK8N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NPSMK8N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
